Start: Alice=100.00, Bob=20.00

=== Commit: both updates appear together ===
  writer, before commit:   Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00
  observer, before commit: Alice=100.00, Bob=20.00
  observer, after commit:  Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00

=== Rollback: the pending change is discarded ===
  writer, before rollback: Alice=50.00, Bob=0.00
  writer, after rollback:  Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00
  observer:                Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00

=== A failed statement does not end the transaction ===
  second INSERT failed: IntegrityError, errno=-670
  writer still holds the first INSERT: Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00, Carol=5.00
  observer:                            Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00
  after rollback(), writer:            Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00

=== autocommit ON: each statement commits on its own ===
  second INSERT failed: IntegrityError, errno=-670
  observer after rollback(): Alice=50.00, Bob=70.00, Carol=5.00
  -> the first INSERT was already committed; rollback() cannot undo it

Dropped cookbook_cdb_ledger
